uest.auth.uid)).data.canChat != false &&\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.chatBan != true &&\n          get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.isBanned != true;\n        // Update message: Admin, or original sender (for editing text/deleting), or recipient participant (for reactions/deletedFor only) (addresses C07)\n        allow update: if isAuthenticated() && (\n          isAdmin() || (\n            resource != null &&\n            (request.auth.uid in get(/databases/$(database)/documents/conversations/$(conversationId)).data.participants) &&\n            request.resource.data.senderId == resource.data.senderId &&\n            (!('id' in request.resource.data) || request.resource.data.id == resource.data.id) &&\n            (!('timestamp' in request.resource.data) || request.resource.data.timestamp == resource.data.timestamp) &&\n            (\n              // Case 1: Original sender can edit text, isEdited, isDeleted, reactions, deletedFor\n              (resource.data.senderId == request.auth.uid) ||\n              // Case 2: Conversation participant (recipient) can ONLY update reactions and/or deletedFor\n              (request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly(['reactions', 'deletedFor']))\n            )\n          )\n        );\n        allow delete: if isAdmin() || (\n          isAuthenticated() && resource != null && resource.data.senderId == request.auth.uid\n        );\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Stories (Social)\n    match /stories/{storyId} {\n      allow read: if isAuthenticated();\n      allow create: if isAuthenticated() &&\n        request.resource.data.userId == request.auth.uid &&\n        get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.canStory != false &&\n        get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.storyBan != true &&\n        get(/databases/$(database)/documents/users/$(request.auth.uid)).data.isBanned != true;\n      allow update, delete: if isAuthenticated() && (resource.data.userId == request.auth.uid || isAdmin());\n    }\n\n    // Audit Logs: Strictly Admin only (/auditLogs/{logId})\n    match /auditLogs/{logId} {\n      allow read, write: if isAdmin();\n    }\n\n    // Prohibit deprecated /audit_logs\n    match /audit_logs/{document=**} {\n      allow read, write: if false;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}]}}
